      "text": "Reentrancy. Lost: 15.7k USD"
    },
    {
      "source": "SlowMist",
      "text": "Standing on Bizness (BIZNESS) appears to have been subjected to a reentrancy attack on Base, resulting in an estimated loss of $15,700."
    },
    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "Bizness was exploited on Base on 27 December 2024 due to a reentrancy flaw in the splitLock function of the Locker contract, resulting in approximately $15,700 in losses. The attack allowed the exploiter to withdraw more tokens than intended by re-entering the contract during the split process. The Locker contract's splitLock function lacked a reentrancy guard. It performed an external call (feeHandler) before updating the internal lock state, enabling an attacker to call withdrawLock in a reentrant manner and drain more tokens than allowed."
    }
  ],
